  <h1 class="research-title">Research Series</h1>
  <p class="ref-lede">Thematic essays on the structural forces behind the rise and collapse of civilisations. Each one compares empires across continents and ages, and ends with what the Institute&#8217;s own data shows.</p>
</header>
